# Test: `ze <command> help` states the invocation form generated from the model
# VALIDATES: AC-1 -- a command with a wire method states a usage line, and the
#            line names every argument the model declares
# PREVENTS: the fixed "<command> [options]" line coming back, which offers
#           subcommands a leaf command does not have and names no argument
#
# The optional filters render as keyword-and-value groups because
# ai/rules/cli.md requires a closed keyword before any operator-supplied value.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze show system sockets help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze show system sockets [protocol <tcp
expect=stderr:contains=[state <state>]
expect=stderr:contains=[port <port>]
reject=stderr:pattern=ze show system sockets <command> \[options\]
